-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Service of Documents Website) Notification 2023 (S 30/2023), made under s 64(5)(b) of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-service-of-documents-website-notification-2023/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S30-2023.txt (lawplain's rendering, line-broken by hand).

§ `Paragraph 2: Website`

-- src:6 | 2. The website maintained by the competent authority at https://www.imda.gov.sg/broadcasting‑act‑directions is prescribed for the purposes of section 64(5)( b ) of the Act.
@ref para 2 (src:6)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the website is the website maintained by the competent authority at https://www.imda.gov.sg/broadcasting-act-directions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`S 30/2023 para 2 the website is prescribed for the purposes of section 64(5)(b) of the Act, on` MEANS
    IF `the Service of Documents Website Notification as deposited is the text in force on` d
    THEN JUST `the website is the website maintained by the competent authority at https://www.imda.gov.sg/broadcasting-act-directions`
    ELSE NOTHING
